Installation 
============

1. Download the latest codebase; go to 
      http://www.lelanthran.com/projects/libxc
   and follow the download instructions.

2. Install the minimum requirements to compile on your system:
   Msys (not supported anymore)
   gcc
   gnu make
   bash
   doxygen (for the documentation)
   latex (for the documentation)
   pdflatex (for the documentation)
   doxy2man (for the documentation)

3. To  build the library do:  
      make all
   This will produce the library file in ./lib and all the headers 
   in ./include.

4. To build the documentation do:
      make documentation
   This will produce all the API docs in ./docs

5. FOR WINDOWS:
   Msys is not supported anymore. Use the Makefile.win file to build
   using mingw32-make/mingw64-make. The environment that this was tested
   in is the mingw32/64 environment that installs with Qt5.4.
